  "body": "<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n<header class=\"site-header\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"Kiln home\"><img src=\"/assets/industrial/kiln-ink.svg\" alt=\"kiln\" width=\"104\" height=\"35\"></a><nav class=\"site-nav\" aria-label=\"Main\"><a href=\"/#local\">KilnOS</a><a href=\"/#hardware\">Hardware</a><a href=\"/about\">About</a><button class=\"nav-contact enquiry-open\">Contact</button></nav><button class=\"header-cta register-open\">Register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><button class=\"menu-toggle\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-menu\" aria-label=\"Open menu\"><span class=\"menu-square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></header>\n<nav class=\"mobile-menu\" id=\"mobile-menu\" aria-label=\"Main menu\" hidden><div class=\"menu-links\"><a href=\"/#local\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>KilnOS<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01</span></a><a href=\"/#hardware\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Hardware<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">02</span></a><a href=\"/about\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>About<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">03</span></a><button class=\"menu-contact enquiry-open\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Contact<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">04</span></button></div><div class=\"menu-bottom\"><button class=\"action primary register-open\">Register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/hardware\">Explore the hardware <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></nav>\n<main id=\"main\"><section class=\"section hardware-intro\"><div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">The Kiln collection</span><span class=\"meta\">One idea. Three scales.</span></div><h1>Find your<br><span>Kiln.</span></h1><p class=\"lead\">One workstation. A team system. A studio rack.</p><p>Choose by workload and GPU capacity. Hardware is in development; specifications and quotes will be confirmed before ordering.</p></section><section class=\"hardware-collection\" aria-label=\"Choose your Kiln\"><a class=\"hardware-card tone-yellow\" href=\"/products/one\"><span class=\"meta\">1–2 GPUs / Hardware ex VAT</span><h2>One</h2><img src=\"/assets/industrial/one-open.webp\" alt=\"Kiln One hardware concept\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\"><p>A dedicated workstation for local AI and focused creative work.</p><div class=\"card-price\"><strong>From £19,900</strong></div><span class=\"text-link\">Explore One <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></span></a><a class=\"hardware-card tone-red\" href=\"/products/atelier\"><span class=\"meta\">2–4 GPUs / Rack-ready</span><h2>Atelier</h2><img src=\"/assets/industrial/atelier-open.webp\" alt=\"Kiln Atelier hardware concept\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\"><p>A rack-ready system for larger models and more parallel creative jobs.</p><div class=\"card-price\"><strong>Request a quote</strong></div><span class=\"text-link\">Explore Atelier <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></span></a><a class=\"hardware-card tone-blue\" href=\"/products/rack\"><span class=\"meta\">8–16 GPUs / Four Ateliers</span><h2>Atelier Rack</h2><img src=\"/assets/industrial/rack-1254.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/industrial/rack-768.webp 768w,/assets/industrial/rack-1254.webp 1254w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 55vw\" alt=\"Four individually removable Kiln Atelier units in a square aluminium rack on casters\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\"><p>A modular installation for several teams, with room to upgrade each Atelier.</p><div class=\"card-price\"><strong>Request a quote</strong></div><span class=\"text-link\">Explore Atelier Rack <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></span></a></section><section class=\"section local software-pricing\" id=\"software-pricing\" aria-labelledby=\"software-pricing-title\"><div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">Managed KilnOS</span><span class=\"meta\">Proposed plans / Billed annually / Ex VAT</span></div><div class=\"section-intro\"><h2 id=\"software-pricing-title\">Priced for<br>your creators.</h2><p>Shared projects, approvals, qualified updates and standard support. Choose the plan for your hardware.</p></div><div class=\"local-grid\"><article><span class=\"meta\">Kiln One</span><h3>£99<br>per creator / month</h3><p>10-creator minimum.<br><strong>£11,880 per year minimum.</strong></p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/products/one#software-pricing\">Explore the plan <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></article><article><span class=\"meta\">Kiln Atelier</span><h3>£89<br>per creator / month</h3><p>30-creator minimum.<br><strong>£32,040 per year minimum.</strong></p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/products/atelier#software-pricing\">Explore the plan <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></article><article><span class=\"meta\">Atelier Rack</span><h3>£79<br>per creator / month</h3><p>120-creator minimum.<br><strong>£113,760 per year minimum.</strong></p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/products/rack#software-pricing\">Explore the plan <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></article></div><p class=\"service-boundary\">Review-only seats are free. Creation and agent actions require a paid creator seat. Hardware, cloud usage, custom integrations and enhanced service levels are additional. Licensed seat counts do not guarantee simultaneous workload capacity.</p></section><section class=\"section hardware-note\"><h2>Stay close.<br>See what’s next.</h2><p>Get product progress and launch details by email. No payment or commitment.</p><button class=\"action primary register-open\">Register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></section></main>\n<footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"footer-main\"><a href=\"/#top\" aria-label=\"Kiln home\"><img src=\"/assets/industrial/kiln-paper.svg\" width=\"135\" height=\"46\" alt=\"kiln\"></a><p>Independent thinking.<br>Local compute.</p><nav aria-label=\"Footer\"><a href=\"/about\">About Kiln</a><a href=\"/#hardware\">The hardware</a><a href=\"/#questions\">Questions</a><a href=\"/#privacy\">Our privacy direction</a><a href=\"/privacy\">Website privacy</a><button class=\"footer-contact enquiry-open\">Contact us ↗</button></nav></div><div class=\"footer-bottom\"><span>© Kiln 2026 / Porto Labs</span><span>Hardware and software in development.</span><a href=\"/#top\">Back to top ↑</a></div></footer>\n<button class=\"mobile-dock register-open\">Register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button>\n<dialog id=\"register-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"register-title\"><button class=\"dialog-close\" aria-label=\"Close registration\">×</button><h2 id=\"register-title\">Keep in<br>touch.</h2><p>Product news and launch updates.</p><form action=\"https://formspree.io/f/xjgepgbg\" method=\"POST\" class=\"enquiry-form\" data-enquiry-kind=\"interest\"><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"register-email\">Email</label><input id=\"register-email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" maxlength=\"254\" autocomplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@studio.com\" required></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"register-product\">Interested in <span>(optional)</span></label><select id=\"register-product\" name=\"product\"><option>Still exploring</option><option>Kiln One</option><option>Kiln Atelier</option><option>Kiln Atelier Rack</option><option>Media</option><option>Legal</option><option>Investor interest</option></select></div><label class=\"consent\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"consent\" required><span>Email me Kiln updates.</span></label><div class=\"form-trap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label>Leave this empty<input name=\"website\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label></div><p class=\"form-note\">Unsubscribe anytime. <a href=\"/privacy\">Privacy</a></p><p class=\"form-error\" role=\"alert\" hidden></p><button class=\"action primary\" type=\"submit\">Keep me posted <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></form><div class=\"form-status\" role=\"status\" hidden><h3>You’re on the list.</h3><p>Thanks for following along.</p><button class=\"text-link dialog-done\">Back to Kiln <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></div></dialog>\n\n<dialog id=\"enquiry-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"enquiry-title\" aria-describedby=\"contact-intro\"><button class=\"dialog-close\" aria-label=\"Close contact\">×</button><h2 id=\"enquiry-title\" tabindex=\"-1\">Let’s talk.</h2><p class=\"contact-intro\" id=\"contact-intro\">What are you working on?</p><form class=\"enquiry-form\" data-enquiry-kind=\"contact\"><input id=\"enquiry-interest\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"reason\" value=\"General question\"><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"work-email\">Your email</label><input id=\"work-email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" maxlength=\"254\" autocomplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@studio.com\" required></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"workflow-message\">Your message</label><textarea id=\"workflow-message\" name=\"message\" rows=\"3\" maxlength=\"3000\" placeholder=\"A project, a question, an idea…\" required></textarea></div><div class=\"form-trap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label>Leave this empty<input name=\"website\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label></div><p class=\"form-error\" role=\"alert\" hidden></p><button class=\"action primary contact-send\" type=\"submit\"><span data-submit-label>Send message</span><span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><p class=\"form-note\">Just a reply. No mailing list. <a href=\"/privacy\">Privacy</a></p></form><div class=\"form-status\" role=\"status\" hidden><h3>Message received.</h3><p>The Kiln team will follow up by email.</p><button class=\"text-link dialog-done\">Back to Kiln <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></div><div class=\"contact-booking\"><span>Prefer a conversation?</span><a href=\"/book/\">Book a call <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></dialog>\n<dialog id=\"compare-dialog\" class=\"compare-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"compare-title\"><button class=\"dialog-close\" aria-label=\"Close comparison\">×</button><span class=\"meta\">Hardware / Compare</span><h2 id=\"compare-title\">Find your fit.</h2><p>Proposed configurations. In development.</p><div class=\"compare-grid\"><article class=\"compare-item\"><h3>Kiln One</h3><strong>From £19,900</strong><p class=\"fine\">1 GPU / ex VAT</p><dl><dt>Graphics</dt><dd>RTX PRO 6000 / 96 GB per GPU</dd><dt>GPU capacity</dt><dd>1 GPU, expandable up to 2</dd><dt>Two-GPU configuration</dt><dd>£31,900 ex VAT</dd><dt>Upgrade when ordering</dt><dd>+£12,000 for a second GPU</dd><dt>System memory / Storage</dt><dd>128 GB / 4 TB</dd><dt>Dimensions / W × H × D</dt><dd>250 × 450 × 460 mm</dd></dl></article><article class=\"compare-item\"><h3>Kiln Atelier</h3><strong>Request a quote</strong><p class=\"fine\">2 or 4 GPUs / hardware</p><dl><dt>Graphics</dt><dd>RTX PRO 6000 Max-Q / 96 GB per GPU</dd><dt>GPU capacity</dt><dd>2 GPUs, expandable up to 4</dd><dt>System memory / Storage</dt><dd>512 GB ECC / 8 TB</dd><dt>Dimensions / W × H × D</dt><dd>520 × 220 × 600 mm</dd></dl></article></div><p class=\"fine\">Atelier Rack combines four Ateliers in a modular enclosure. All figures are engineering targets, subject to validation. GPU memory is per card; multiple cards do not automatically form one memory pool. Renders show expanded component concepts.</p><button class=\"text-link dialog-done\">Back to the hardware <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></dialog>\n",
